{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_st01",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_st01",
  "title": "未完成的告别",
  "storyCode": "BB-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d9c5b5c67aa50e8645c145ff6bce1e95cd4319def54485ddb8d10abe4224dbc7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男孩在梦中哭泣，女孩将男孩裹在自己抵挡风雪的斗篷中，为他拭去了眼泪。\n冰冷。断续。呼啸。\n巨人轻轻讲述一部遥远的史诗......\n她的声音穿越了风雪的裂隙。\n众魂的呼唤为其和音，男孩的呜咽敲打着节拍。\n女孩在梦中的酷寒中微微喘息，她捂住了男孩的眼睛，然后闭上了眼。\n千年前的歌谣仍在他们眼前演绎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“这就是此章的结尾。”\n巨人淡入了梦中的风雪中，将孩子抛弃在身后。\n男孩渐渐不再听到自己啼哭的声音。\n他醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_thundercloud"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1094年夏\n卡兹戴尔地区，荒废小镇外"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是此章的结尾，阿斯卡纶。我的故事说完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我的族人......独眼巨人深入北境前，最后望向卡兹戴尔的所见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一章是已然逝去的未知历史，是尚未临近的可能未来，抑或是毫无意义的呓语？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近千年来，无人知晓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到他们出现，命运的湍流开始岔进更窄、更确定的河道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，她所见的命运，已经近在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不关心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，难得你有耐心听我说完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红色的鲜血慢慢沿着他的面具下沿滑落到了他的胸口。\n阿斯卡纶微微眯眼，他已走投无路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会死，所以我给你最后的尊重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳。呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我们认识开始，你从未把那些个预言放在心上，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......你永远不会理解一个贪婪的人对控制命运的渴望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死前少废话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你急着去和巴别塔那些人会合，但现在还没到你走的时候。你看，天灾快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......我倒开始好奇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在风暴之中，找到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "委托必须完成，这是我自己在疤痕商场定下的规矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡纶的身形在他的背后消失，同一时间，薄暮般的雾气已经绕紧巨人的脖颈，将他的身躯高悬于危崖之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你有看到过自己的结局吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不在乎预言，和你一样，哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但事实就是，我们都逃不开命运。你不想挣扎吗？凭什么？为什么？怎么能够？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要忘了，预言中也有你的一席之地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "呜咽。风暴。\n哀婉的吟唱在他们的耳畔响起，来自女妖河谷的挽歌掠过地平，卷入风暴中央。\n阿斯卡纶的身体不由自主地战栗着，她浑身冰凉。\n一阵无法诉说的刺痛从她的耳后一路激荡到脚底。\n没有名字的挽歌，不祥的预兆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别了......卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡纶听到了一声叹息。\n她的手越握越紧，直到“疤眼”的喉咙无法发出一丝轻微的声音。\n然后，她松开了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈，该死的命运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眨眼间，独眼巨人的巨大身体成了悬崖下一个渺小的点。\n薄雾在狂风中散去，连同兜帽投下的阴影一起，消失在坠落悬崖的泪水中。\n喘息声，天灾云中低沉的雷鸣，风沙席卷荒地的呼啸......\n万物的声音归于沉寂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_victoria"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "维多利亚，伦蒂尼姆"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "属于她的萨卡兹，抬起头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你们还要履行她交予的使命，我就站在这里，等你们上前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我准许你们为她复仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的衣服上，绣了我的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是特蕾西娅殿下亲自刺绣的，而它此刻正微微发烫，我知道......这意味着什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅殿下交给我们的任务已经结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不再向你举剑。萨卡兹不会在外敌前刀剑相向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们，向你效忠，摄政王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你仍然抱有对萨卡兹的热忱，我们便甘愿把性命交给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使你们险些毁掉了我们在维多利亚的一切布置？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果军事委员会决定让我们死，我们可以死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要这能带来更好的结果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那便如她所愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们方才还是险些葬送计划的叛党头目，让我怎么相信——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“如她所愿”，是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的名字，刽子手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺杀者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤莉叶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会记住你的名字，也会交给你最后的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卫兵，刺客，佣兵，这场血战的每一位幸存者——我要你们踏入诸王长眠之所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要你们拆碎维多利亚的钢铁心脏，在那里伏击并剿灭所有的蒸汽骑士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是军事委员会削弱伦蒂尼姆的核心计划，让我们也参与？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德会看好你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是不是，不可能活着离开那里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大可去争取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是看看，是什么样的人培养出了阿斯卡纶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她始终没有摆脱你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在我发誓追随特蕾西娅殿下时，从未想过那一对改写了卡兹戴尔历史的混血双子的故事会如此落幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更没想到，原来我这种贱命胚子，也在这段故事之中有了一席之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永别了，特雷西斯殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会把对你的憎恨，带进坟墓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡兹戴尔地区，巴别塔罗德岛本舰"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "自诞生于世的那一天起，凯尔希从未感到这道长廊如此漫长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，咳哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勋爵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要安葬我们，卡兹戴尔的土地再不能容下更多叛徒了。"
